(setq register-alist '((114) (48 . #("\\subsection{{QReach}: {A} {Reachability} {Analysis} {Tool} for {Quantum} {Markov} {Chains}~\\cite{dai_qreach_2024}}\n\nDai and Ying present QReach, a reachability analyzer for quantum Markov chains\nbuilt on the CFLOBDD decision diagram. It computes the reachable subspace with a\nbreadth-first search that pushes each new basis vector through the Kraus\noperators and keeps only the part orthogonal to what has already been found,\nclaiming $O(d^3)$ time versus $O(d^{4.7454})$ for the earlier Choi-matrix\nmethod. \n\n%%% Local Variables:\n%%% mode: latex\n%%% TeX-master: \"../main.tex\"\n%%% End:\n" 0 11 (face (font-lock-keyword-face font-latex-sedate-face) fontified t) 11 12 (fontified t) 12 91 (face (font-latex-sectioning-3-face) fontified t) 91 96 (face (font-lock-keyword-face font-latex-sectioning-3-face font-latex-sedate-face) fontified t) 96 97 (face (font-latex-sectioning-3-face) fontified t) 97 112 (face (font-lock-constant-face font-latex-sectioning-3-face) fontified t) 112 113 (face (font-latex-sectioning-3-face) fontified t) 113 435 (fontified t) 435 439 (face font-latex-math-face fontified t) 439 440 (face (font-latex-script-char-face font-latex-math-face) fontified t) 440 443 (face font-latex-math-face fontified t) 443 456 (fontified t) 456 460 (face font-latex-math-face fontified t) 460 461 (face (font-latex-script-char-face font-latex-math-face) fontified t) 461 471 (face font-latex-math-face fontified t) 471 510 (fontified t) 510 514 (face font-lock-comment-delimiter-face fontified t) 514 531 (face font-lock-comment-face fontified t) 531 535 (face font-lock-comment-delimiter-face fontified t) 535 547 (face font-lock-comment-face fontified t) 547 551 (face font-lock-comment-delimiter-face fontified t) 551 577 (face font-lock-comment-face fontified t) 577 581 (face font-lock-comment-delimiter-face fontified t) 581 586 (face font-lock-comment-face fontified t)))))
